 Fixes the map/filter stop reported in v36. The map-open check uses independent Back/zoom/world-tab controls when the old title image does not match its background. An open map is not tapped again at the gameplay minimap position. Transitional frames are rechecked without a fixed per-location wait. An already-open filter is dismissed once through the calibrated Back control; the resulting state is observed before another input. Failed recovery preserves progress and Stop/F10 stays stopped.
